[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba経済圏を3つの圏(sphere)と膜(membrane)の通過規則全列挙として定義する:\n    準圏(junbi — 外部決済、USDC on Base L2はetzhayyim junbi Safe custody、fiatは\n    gftdcojp custody)/ 労圏(murakumo memory×time credits — 労働のみが発行、推論で\n    burn、換金不可の前払い使用権)/ 縁圏(EN — net-zero・非発行・非価格の相互信用、\n    どの圏とも交換不可)。新しい通貨・トークンは作らない" "膜規則(ここに無い流れは禁止): fiat/USDC→credits可(一方向mint、5%treasury)/\n    credits→fiat禁止(credits.cljcの『or fiat payout』docstringは削除する)/\n    x402 USDC→推論可だがcredits foldに合流(USDC収益はtreasuryへ、貢献ノードは\n    creditsをearn — 支払フロントエンドは2つ、経済は1つ)/ credits↔EN双方向禁止/\n    EN↔USDC双方向禁止/ ADR-2607030030のchain gatewayはmint-onlyに読み替え\n    (burn側=credits→チェーン資産は換金禁止に抵触するため作らない)。内部単位が\n    どちらも償還不能であることが構造的な非投機性の証明になる" "treasuryの一本化: 記録(credits台帳の:treasury口座=支出予算の残高)/\n    保管(dual-axis — fiat=gftdcojp、chain=etzhayyim junbi Safe。cloud-murakumoの\n    MURAKUMO_TREASURY_ADDRはjunbi Safeを指す、第3のcustodyを作らない)/\n    統治(kekkai :treasury/releaseのallow/deny記録なしにcustodianは動かさない)\n    の三権分立" "witness報酬の再設計(ADR-2607994000 Decision #7を部分supersede): per-EN-transfer\n    の外部資産手数料を廃止(ENの移動に外部価格を貼り非価格理念を裏口から破壊する\n    ため)。witnessの務め(block検証・recompute検証)は労働であり、ADR-2607030030の\n    労働裏付け発行をwitness dutyに拡張してcreditsをmintする(finalize block数に\n    対する定額 — EN移動量に比例させない)。外部資産での支払いが必要な場合は\n    on-ramp収益からkekkai release記録を経てstake加重2/3 governance投票で\n    サービス対価として開ける" "slashing原則の統一: slashしてよいのは暗号学的・決定論的に議論の余地なく証明\n    できる不正のみ — 縁圏はequivocation、労圏は決定論的recompute不一致\n    (verify/compute.cljcのreject verdict)。どちらも異議申立て機構不要。\n    liveness障害は両圏とも無罰則(active set除外のみ)" "witness市場の統一: bond市場は1つ、役割はタグ({did -> {:amount N :roles\n    #{:ordering :recompute}}})。bond・unbond delay・slashing・kekkai統治・報酬\n    経路は共通、ハードウェア差はrole self-selectionで表現" "engi/L1とcredits台帳の衝突条項解消(ADR-2607993000を部分supersede):\n    『murakumo経済台帳を巻き込まない』はPhase 3が台帳にグローバル順序を要求する\n    までの時限条項に再スコープ。その時はcredits台帳がengi/L1の2番目のドメインに\n    なる(ADR-2607101200の『複数の消費者』着手条件の充足でもある)" "署名の義務化gate: 外部参加者受け入れ前に /infer/runs //infer/spend のCACAO署名\n    必須化(:who自己申告廃止)・receiptのactor署名必須化・ledger/witnessのquorum\n    結線を完了する。それまでは単一オペレータ信頼と正直にラベルする" "スコープ外の明示: ノード所有シェア+収益シェアSKU(storefront.cljc)は証券類似で\n    経済圏の外の資本取引 — 別ADRで扱い、それまで販売を拡大しない。HAKARIは\n    unit of accountのまま(J1/J12不変)" "正直に明記した依存関係: witness報酬がcredits建てである限り外部第三者の参加誘因は\n    弱く、実獲得にはon-ramp収益からのサービス対価が現実には必要 — 経済圏の分散化は\n    経済圏の売上に律速される(現状Stripe有効サブスク0)"], :adr/supersedes ["90-docs/adr/2607030030-murakumo-inference-economy-gtm.md (partial: chain gatewayをmint-onlyに読み替え、creditsのfiat payout可能性を明示否定)" "90-docs/adr/2607993000-engi-l1-byzantine-consensus-en-currency.md (partial: murakumo経済台帳の除外条項をPhase 3までの時限に再スコープ)" "90-docs/adr/2607994000-engi-l1-permissionless-staking-equivocation-slashing.md (partial: Decision #7のper-transfer外部手数料を廃止、witness労働のcredits mintに置換)"], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-three-sphere-economy", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607030030-murakumo-inference-economy-gtm.md" "90-docs/adr/2607101100-engi-mutual-credit-kotobase-native-design.md" "90-docs/adr/2607993000-engi-l1-byzantine-consensus-en-currency.md" "90-docs/adr/2607994000-engi-l1-permissionless-staking-equivocation-slashing.md" "90-docs/adr/2607021800-junbi-reserve-treasury-hakari-basket.md" "90-docs/adr/2607071000-etzhayyim-dual-axis-doctrine.md" "90-docs/adr/2607093100-x402-payment-protocol.md" "90-docs/adr/2607110300-kotoba-lang-net-kotobase-cloud-murakumo-decentralization-roadmap.md" "orgs/kotoba-lang/murakumo/src/murakumo/infer/credits.cljc" "orgs/gftdcojp/cloud-murakumo/src/pay/core.cljc" "orgs/kotoba-lang/engi" "orgs/kotoba-lang/en"], :adr/status "accepted (unified design; implementation corrections enumerated as follow-ups, not executed in this ADR)", :adr/id "adr-2607995000-kotoba-three-sphere-economy", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-15", :adr/decision "{:spheres {:junbi \"external settlement: USDC on Base L2 (etzhayyim junbi Safe) + fiat (gftdcojp/Stripe)\", :credits \"murakumo memory×time — labor-only issuance, burned on inference, NON-redeemable prepaid usage claim\", :en \"mutual credit — net-zero, non-minted, non-priced, non-convertible to anything\"}, :membranes {:fiat->credits :allowed-one-way-mint-5pct-treasury, :credits->fiat :forbidden, :x402-usdc->inference :allowed-but-joins-credits-fold, :credits<->en :forbidden-both-ways, :en<->usdc :forbidden-both-ways, :chain-gateway :mint-only-no-burn}, :non-speculation-proof \"neither internal unit is redeemable, so neither can be an investment — structural, not policy\", :treasury {:record \"credits ledger :treasury account\", :custody {:fiat \"gftdcojp\", :chain \"etzhayyim junbi Safe (MURAKUMO_TREASURY_ADDR points here)\"}, :governance \"kekkai :treasury/release records mandatory before custodian moves anything\"}, :witness-rewards \"per-finalized-block flat credits mint (witness duty = labor, extends ADR-2607030030 labor-backed issuance); external-asset service payments only via governance vote from real on-ramp revenue — NOT per-EN-transfer fees (repealed)\", :slashing-principle \"objectively-provable faults only: equivocation (ordering) + deterministic recompute mismatch (compute); no dispute mechanism needed; liveness never slashed\", :witness-market \"one bond market, role tags {:ordering :recompute}, shared bond/delay/slashing/governance\", :engi-l1-scope \"credits ledger excluded until Phase 3 needs global ordering, then joins engi/L1 as 2nd domain (no new L1)\", :signing-gate \"CACAO-signed submissions + signed receipts + wired witness quorum REQUIRED before any non-operator participant\", :out-of-scope [\"node ownership-share SKUs (securities-like, separate ADR, no expansion until then)\" \"HAKARI stays unit-of-account (J1/J12 unchanged)\"], :honest-dependency \"decentralization of the zone is rate-limited by the zone's revenue (Stripe active subs currently 0)\"}", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607995000: 縁(EN)・労(credits)・準(junbi/USDC) 三圏経済 — kotoba 経済圏の統合設計"}]
